    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="7124a589-67e9-5751-9a63-077cb8c5c34d" activityNameId="12db4a33-acbe-519b-8816-78912f6bdc66" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Alkyd paint, white, 60% in solvent, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Alkyd paint, white, 60% in solvent, at plant
Alkyd paints can be made of many different resins. This dataset stands for one specific long oil alkyd as used in architectural paints of white colour and should not be used for other alkyds if it's contribution to the overall result is important. The data quality is not sufficient to allow for e.g. a comparative assessment of different paints.\nTechnology: Physical mixing of inputs.\nVersion: 2.2\nEnergy values: Undefined\nProduction volume: unknown\nLocal category: Lacke &amp; Farben, Leime\nLocal subcategory: Herstellung\nUVEK 2022 source file:01670.XML\n\n
UUID: c71e846e-c411-3e1e-8cc2-b565af8a4155
Transport of raw materials and production of paint. Packaging is neglected.
Location: undefined
Technology: Physical mixing of inputs.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: A "typical" solvent-borne white alkyd paint is chosen and its raw material consumption is calculated. Energy data are estimated. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c71e846e-c411-3e1e-8cc2-b565af8a4155.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
